 it, however, as the white-haired girl who rode on the bus with him guides him to a power unlike anything he's ever known.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.7}],"value":7.7,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":5271,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}